  - m_Id: 8216963039275
    m_Localized: Use the joystick to walk around the lab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039276
    m_Localized: Drag on the right side of the screen to look around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039277
    m_Localized: drag with mouse or touchpad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039278
    m_Localized: Tap PICK to grab the item you are aiming at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039279
    m_Localized: Aim the + at any item on the floor. PICK appears when you can grab
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039280
    m_Localized: Pick up an item first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039281
    m_Localized: Tap PLACE. The first item on a rack decides what that rack holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039282
    m_Localized: Walk to the marked rack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039283
    m_Localized: m), then aim the + anywhere on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039284
    m_Localized: Find an empty rack on this floor, or one holding the same item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039285
    m_Localized: Pick up another item first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039286
    m_Localized: Tap DROP to throw one item gently forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039287
    m_Localized: Your item will drop forward when there is room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039288
    m_Localized: Nice! This rack now holds that item type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039289
    m_Localized: DROP throws one item gently forward. Select a type in your hand
      to use SEARCH or MAGNET. Get tools with cash, optional reward videos or the
      store. Tap GOT IT to continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039290
    m_Localized: Well done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039291
    m_Localized: Now sort every item to finish the lab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039292
    m_Localized: STEP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039293
    m_Localized: RACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039294
    m_Localized: MOVE & LOOK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039295
    m_Localized: Use the left joystick to move. Drag the right side to look around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039296
    m_Localized: 'On desktop: WASD to move, drag to look. Adjust look sensitivity
      in Settings.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039297
    m_Localized: PICK & DROP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039298
    m_Localized: Aim at an outlined item. Tap PICK for one item, or hold to collect
      more of that type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039299
    m_Localized: Hands start with 10 slots. DROP drops one selected item per tap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039300
    m_Localized: SORT YOUR RACKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039301
    m_Localized: Tap an inventory category to select it. Aim at a green rack and
      tap or hold PLACE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039302
    m_Localized: The first item assigns the whole rack. Pick all its items back up
      to reset it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039303
    m_Localized: TOOLS & REWARDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039304
    m_Localized: SEARCH and MAGNET use your selected category anywhere in the lab.
      Full hands never charge for magnet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039305
    m_Localized: Small milestone rewards help you progress. Get tools with cash,
      optional reward videos or the store. ITEM PROGRESS shows what remains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039306
    m_Localized: Changes save automatically. Close this panel to try your look speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039307
    m_Localized: Reset changes controls and feedback only; sorting progress stays
      safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039308
    m_Localized: Remaining includes floor items and items in your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039309
    m_Localized: Remove Ads disables automatic ads. Reward videos remain optional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039310
    m_Localized: "Offline \u2014 sorting is still available."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
